WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.448
We are moving house. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:05.448 --> 00:00:11.640
Our things go into boxes. The boxes get labels.

3
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:16.392
A van comes, and the boxes go into the van.

4
00:00:16.392 --> 00:00:20.064
The van drives to the new house.

5
00:00:20.064 --> 00:00:25.272
The boxes come into the new rooms in the same order they left.

6
00:00:25.272 --> 00:00:31.200
Our bed gets built early, so we can sleep in it the first night.

7
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:36.744
Our things are in new places, but they are the same things.

8
00:00:36.744 --> 00:00:42.120
Little by little, the new house starts to feel like ours.

9
00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:50.328
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

